    "Builds from GitHub Actions, kept for 7 days. To download them, add a token that can read Actions for Lakr233/vphone-cli. The token is stored in your keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Builds from GitHub Actions, kept for 7 days. To download them, add a token that can read Actions for Lakr233/vphone-cli. The token is stored in your keychain."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GitHub Actions のビルドで、7 日間保持されます。ダウンロードするには、Lakr233/vphone-cli の Actions を読み取れるトークンを追加してください。トークンはキーチェーンに保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GitHub Actions의 빌드로, 7일간 보관됩니다. 다운로드하려면 Lakr233/vphone-cli의 Actions를 읽을 수 있는 토큰을 추가하십시오. 토큰은 키체인에 저장됩니다."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
